WEBVTT

00:00:35.910 --> 00:00:38.490
<i>Welcome, my friend.</i>

00:00:38.700 --> 00:00:43.710
<i>Criminals of Gotham City</i>
<i>are my experimental subjects now.</i>

00:00:56.680 --> 00:01:01.600
You will not interfere
with my experiment this time, Batman.

00:01:05.440 --> 00:01:06.480
Catwoman!

00:01:46.180 --> 00:01:48.440
SMILE

00:01:59.070 --> 00:02:00.820
Where am I?

00:02:14.340 --> 00:02:15.670
WANTED NOTICE

00:02:15.760 --> 00:02:18.550
Is this written in Japanese?

00:02:25.970 --> 00:02:27.560
There he is, get him!

00:02:27.640 --> 00:02:28.690
Samurai?

00:02:30.230 --> 00:02:33.190
Stop! I am not dangerous person.

00:02:36.440 --> 00:02:37.650
Fine, have it your way.

00:02:41.820 --> 00:02:45.490
You are the one we've been looking for.

00:02:45.740 --> 00:02:48.580
We were sent to find the man
dressed as a bat.

00:02:49.210 --> 00:02:51.880
Our master has ordered us
to kill him on sight.

00:02:52.250 --> 00:02:53.590
Who's your master?

00:04:27.970 --> 00:04:29.890
Everything's offline, even GPS.

00:04:30.350 --> 00:04:31.680
None of this makes any sense.

00:04:31.770 --> 00:04:33.810
But from the look of it,
this is ancient Japan.

00:04:36.440 --> 00:04:38.520
Who is the master...

00:04:54.920 --> 00:04:55.960
<i>What?</i>

00:04:58.130 --> 00:04:59.290
<i>The Joker? </i>

00:04:59.540 --> 00:05:01.170
That's right, Bats.

00:05:01.250 --> 00:05:02.590
It is me.

00:05:03.380 --> 00:05:04.420
Damn you!

00:05:08.050 --> 00:05:09.100
Hi.

00:05:10.970 --> 00:05:12.390
And Harley Quinn.

00:05:12.720 --> 00:05:14.270
You owe me.

00:05:14.350 --> 00:05:18.560
I'm greeting you like this
even though I am so busy.

00:05:18.860 --> 00:05:22.070
I heard about you from a Samurai earlier.

00:05:23.690 --> 00:05:26.030
Haven't you heard?
Everyone's been calling me

00:05:26.110 --> 00:05:28.780
Dairokuten Mao,
the Demon King of Owari province.

00:05:28.870 --> 00:05:30.910
The most powerful man in Japan.

00:05:30.990 --> 00:05:32.490
But you can call me...

00:05:33.410 --> 00:05:35.290
Lord Joker.

00:05:36.750 --> 00:05:39.000
Do you know the meaning of "Owari"?

00:05:39.080 --> 00:05:41.380
It means "the end" in English.

00:05:42.000 --> 00:05:45.260
It is the perfect county for me,
don't you think?

00:05:45.670 --> 00:05:47.590
<i>Guess I have that monkey</i>
<i>to thank for this.</i>

00:05:47.680 --> 00:05:49.640
<i>If it wasn't for his stupid machine,</i>

00:05:49.720 --> 00:05:52.510
<i>this tiny island would have</i>
<i>never been on my itinerary.</i>

00:05:52.810 --> 00:05:56.850
I thought you will be here, too.
So I was looking for you.

00:05:57.230 --> 00:05:59.400
My dear bat.

00:06:10.530 --> 00:06:13.450
It's so rude to kick someone.

00:06:17.710 --> 00:06:20.540
We should fight graciously.

00:06:23.550 --> 00:06:26.260
<i>This is not good, Batman.</i>

00:06:28.510 --> 00:06:31.800
We are just logging.

00:06:32.470 --> 00:06:36.140
Poison Ivy would be very disappointed.

00:06:37.430 --> 00:06:41.190
Didn't they teach you in primary school
to protect nature?

00:06:43.190 --> 00:06:45.400
You're the one who keeps cutting them.

00:06:45.480 --> 00:06:47.610
Because you won't let the fan hit you.

00:06:59.500 --> 00:07:03.590
There are no primary schools
in ancient Japan.

00:07:06.340 --> 00:07:09.050
You know so much about history.

00:07:09.130 --> 00:07:11.220
You are a history nerd.

00:07:11.550 --> 00:07:14.640
That's my bats,
you have all the bases covered.

00:07:19.310 --> 00:07:21.520
This is getting nowhere.

00:07:47.420 --> 00:07:50.470
Should we go after him, Mr. J?

00:07:51.260 --> 00:07:52.760
We have lots of time.

00:07:52.880 --> 00:07:54.890
Let's just enjoy the moonlight.

00:08:07.820 --> 00:08:11.860
Move, move! He can't be far.

00:08:25.420 --> 00:08:26.540
Indeed...

00:08:27.130 --> 00:08:28.380
You are late.

00:08:28.630 --> 00:08:29.670
<i>Selina?</i>

00:08:33.010 --> 00:08:35.340
-Two years?
-Yes.

00:08:35.680 --> 00:08:38.470
It's been two years since we got here.

00:08:39.510 --> 00:08:42.770
Because of the
Gorilla Grodd's time machine.

00:08:43.690 --> 00:08:45.400
What happened?

00:08:52.610 --> 00:08:55.240
<i>Criminals of Gotham City,</i>
<i>Whoever I've gathered here</i>

00:08:55.360 --> 00:08:58.280
<i>are my experimental subjects now.</i>

00:09:02.330 --> 00:09:03.620
<i>This is Nightwing.</i>

00:09:03.710 --> 00:09:06.250
<i>The lead paid off. It's like</i>
<i>a criminal convention here.</i>

00:09:06.670 --> 00:09:09.040
<i>Yeah, I can see them from here, too.</i>

00:09:09.500 --> 00:09:12.170
<i>But the Mayor's party is tonight.</i>

00:09:12.420 --> 00:09:13.510
At that time,

00:09:13.800 --> 00:09:15.260
I was not alone.

00:09:16.010 --> 00:09:18.340
Nightwing, Red Hood,

00:09:18.430 --> 00:09:20.390
Red Robin, and Robin.

00:09:20.970 --> 00:09:22.390
So where are they?

00:09:22.850 --> 00:09:23.890
I don't know.

00:09:24.060 --> 00:09:25.690
I haven't seen any of them.

00:09:26.440 --> 00:09:30.270
<i>But since arriving, Gotham's criminals</i>
<i>have run wild all over Japan.</i>

00:09:31.610 --> 00:09:34.400
<i>Behold, the Quake Engine.</i>

00:09:34.530 --> 00:09:37.740
<i>Now witness as I become</i>
<i>master of time and space,</i>

00:09:37.820 --> 00:09:39.870
<i>and bend them to my will.</i>

00:09:44.000 --> 00:09:46.160
<i>It was you, Gorilla Grodd.</i>

00:09:46.500 --> 00:09:48.080
<i>What are you plotting?</i>

00:09:48.170 --> 00:09:50.540
There are no more images.

00:09:50.670 --> 00:09:53.300
Grodd's machine must have affected
the data transfer.

00:09:53.380 --> 00:09:55.760
<i>What have you done to us?</i>

00:09:55.840 --> 00:10:00.350
<i>I think that monkey has been</i>
<i>mucking with our heads.</i>

00:10:00.600 --> 00:10:04.100
<i>You will not interfere with</i>
<i>my experiment this time, Batman!</i>

00:10:17.200 --> 00:10:19.570
But why the two-year difference?

00:10:20.120 --> 00:10:22.330
Who knows how time travel works?

00:10:22.700 --> 00:10:25.620
Grodd delayed me,

00:10:26.160 --> 00:10:29.420
and it must have affected the jump.

00:10:30.250 --> 00:10:34.090
A matter of seconds then,
turned to be two years now.

00:10:35.170 --> 00:10:37.510
I followed Gorilla Grodd to Arkham
to see what he was up to that night.

00:10:37.630 --> 00:10:41.430
If it was any good,
I was planning on stealing it.

00:10:41.850 --> 00:10:45.520
I never thought I'd end up here.

00:10:46.180 --> 00:10:47.230
And the other criminals?

00:10:47.810 --> 00:10:50.100
Like the Joker, they've taken over.

00:10:50.230 --> 00:10:52.440
They've deceived all the <i>Sengoku Daimyos</i>

00:10:52.520 --> 00:10:54.440
and become lords of their states.

00:10:54.860 --> 00:10:56.070
<i>Sengoku Daimyo?</i>

00:10:56.530 --> 00:10:57.650
That's right.

00:10:57.940 --> 00:11:01.110
This period in Japan
is a feudal era of warring states.

00:11:01.450 --> 00:11:06.740
<i>Yes. All of Gotham's criminals</i>
<i>trying to conquer and unify Japan.</i>

00:11:08.370 --> 00:11:11.000
<i>The Penguin has seized control</i>
<i>of the state of Kai.</i>

00:11:11.080 --> 00:11:14.250
<i>He skirmishes repeatedly</i>
<i>with the neighboring state of Echigo.</i>

00:11:16.050 --> 00:11:19.010
<i>Fly, my fine-feathered friends.</i>

00:11:25.140 --> 00:11:27.600
<i>I'll bury you in the dirt,</i>
<i>you old buzzard.</i>

00:11:31.480 --> 00:11:34.270
<i>In the state of Mutsu,</i>
<i>Deathstroke reigns supreme.</i>

00:11:35.940 --> 00:11:39.070
<i>Once my fortress is complete,</i>
<i>it'll be my turn to strike. Yeah.</i>

00:11:40.990 --> 00:11:43.620
<i>Two-Face has taken control</i>
<i>in the state of Omie near the capital.</i>

00:11:43.700 --> 00:11:45.580
<i>He has become a vassal of the Joker.</i>

00:11:49.830 --> 00:11:52.330
<i>Let's see, what will my next move be?</i>

00:11:55.000 --> 00:11:59.260
<i>But right now, the feudal lord</i>
<i>who is closest to unifying Japan</i>

00:11:59.800 --> 00:12:00.970
<i>is the Joker.</i>

00:12:15.230 --> 00:12:19.320
So they're all trying to take over
this country and rewrite history.

00:12:20.780 --> 00:12:23.030
Where we can find Gorilla Grodd?

00:12:23.110 --> 00:12:24.280
I don't know.

00:12:25.740 --> 00:12:28.240
Why don't you and I join forces, Bruce?

00:12:28.370 --> 00:12:29.410
Join forces?

00:12:29.490 --> 00:12:32.620
I want to go back
to the other period I lived.

00:12:32.870 --> 00:12:34.920
To Gotham city in the 21st Century?

00:12:35.630 --> 00:12:36.670
Right.

00:12:37.170 --> 00:12:41.260
Joker keeps Grodd's
time machine in the castle tower.

00:12:59.400 --> 00:13:01.030
This missionary look is not bad.

00:13:01.480 --> 00:13:03.400
There were quite a lot of
Christian missionaries

00:13:03.490 --> 00:13:05.280
that came to Japan during this era.

00:13:05.610 --> 00:13:08.570
This way you won't look
too suspicious as a westerner.

00:13:08.870 --> 00:13:09.830
I see.

00:13:18.210 --> 00:13:19.590
<i>Is that coal?</i>

00:13:21.170 --> 00:13:23.090
TEA

00:13:25.930 --> 00:13:28.720
The industrial revolution
wasn't until much later.

00:13:29.050 --> 00:13:32.100
I really doubt the Joker
cares much about history.

00:13:32.310 --> 00:13:34.480
When the castle is done,

00:13:34.680 --> 00:13:36.810
he'll start ruling this country.

00:13:37.150 --> 00:13:38.600
But it's not just the Joker.

00:13:38.770 --> 00:13:41.690
We'll have to defeat all
of Gotham's criminals to save history.

00:13:43.150 --> 00:13:44.320
We'll need weapons for that.

00:13:44.940 --> 00:13:47.660
We don't even have the Batwing.

00:13:48.030 --> 00:13:50.070
Here is your tea.

00:13:50.620 --> 00:13:52.290
How should we approach...

00:13:56.710 --> 00:13:57.960
Black tea?

00:13:58.040 --> 00:13:59.960
Hard to come by
in this neck of the woods.

00:14:00.040 --> 00:14:02.170
Hope you find it to your liking.

00:14:02.380 --> 00:14:03.420
<i>Alfred?</i>

00:14:04.880 --> 00:14:07.760
I've been waiting for you,
Mr. Bruce.

00:14:16.640 --> 00:14:17.690
What?

00:14:18.980 --> 00:14:21.060
You knew about this, Selina.

00:14:21.520 --> 00:14:24.650
I know, but I wanted to see
the look of surprise on your face.

00:14:24.980 --> 00:14:29.240
I was waiting for you in this that night.

00:14:29.740 --> 00:14:31.910
Right, with Selina...

00:14:32.740 --> 00:14:35.750
Alfred cooked Western-style food,

00:14:35.830 --> 00:14:37.580
I didn't have to worry about meals.

00:14:38.040 --> 00:14:41.460
He even makes black tea
by fermenting Japanese tea leaves.

00:14:41.920 --> 00:14:42.960
Impressive.

00:14:43.040 --> 00:14:46.420
<i>Well, I haven't gotten</i>
<i>coffee beans yet.</i>

00:14:47.380 --> 00:14:48.340
Does it run?

00:14:48.590 --> 00:14:52.970
Well, I thought you knew that
it's not that weak to be broken

00:14:53.140 --> 00:14:57.140
even though you haven't ridden
for two years.

00:14:57.390 --> 00:15:00.730
I guess I was wrong.

00:15:01.230 --> 00:15:04.480
If you can't trust how I maintain it,

00:15:04.570 --> 00:15:07.150
I suggest not to ride at all.

00:15:08.400 --> 00:15:10.530
I feel easier when I hear you
speak like that.

00:15:10.950 --> 00:15:13.870
I feel like this thatched roof
became the batcave.

00:15:14.030 --> 00:15:16.830
Didn't mean to brag, sir,
but it is quite good.

00:15:17.120 --> 00:15:18.580
I'm sure it is.

00:15:21.370 --> 00:15:22.420
Get down!

00:15:24.210 --> 00:15:25.250
Fire!

00:15:28.970 --> 00:15:30.380
Yeah!

00:15:37.010 --> 00:15:38.270
Quickly, spread out.

00:15:38.430 --> 00:15:40.020
I'm going to storm inside the castle.

00:15:40.100 --> 00:15:42.600
Selina, take Alfred somewhere safe.

00:15:42.730 --> 00:15:43.770
You got it.

00:16:04.630 --> 00:16:06.000
Mr. J!

00:16:07.040 --> 00:16:08.090
What's that?

00:16:08.170 --> 00:16:10.670
Batman's here!

00:16:14.800 --> 00:16:17.010
Take aim! Fire!

00:16:19.020 --> 00:16:21.640
<i>He's in his batmobile.</i>

00:16:21.730 --> 00:16:25.940
And he's rapidly approaching,
beaten the gunmen and our cannons.

00:16:28.360 --> 00:16:31.110
He's nothing without
his secret weapon.

00:16:31.190 --> 00:16:33.360
Which gives me an interesting idea.

00:16:38.620 --> 00:16:39.660
Nice try.

00:16:43.370 --> 00:16:46.380
I always surpass your imagination.

00:16:46.460 --> 00:16:48.630
I'm the Lord Joker.

00:16:49.210 --> 00:16:52.510
Harley, activate Arkham Castle!

00:16:52.630 --> 00:16:55.220
But, puddin', the castle
isn't even finished yet.

00:16:55.300 --> 00:16:57.390
But this is the Batman!

00:16:57.470 --> 00:17:00.390
He's the reason
we made it in the first place.

00:17:00.520 --> 00:17:01.680
Right.

00:17:09.610 --> 00:17:11.730
Get ready, Joker.

00:17:33.510 --> 00:17:35.300
What the hell is that?

00:17:36.470 --> 00:17:37.640
An arm on the castle?

00:17:41.260 --> 00:17:43.100
<i>What's wrong? </i>

00:17:43.180 --> 00:17:47.980
<i>Are you scared of how smart I am?</i>

00:17:48.230 --> 00:17:49.560
Here!

00:17:50.940 --> 00:17:51.980
Don't play with me.

00:17:57.450 --> 00:17:58.740
Now it's my turn.

00:18:04.370 --> 00:18:05.910
<i>Storming the gate.</i>

00:18:07.080 --> 00:18:10.960
<i>Do you think it's that easy?</i>

00:18:14.380 --> 00:18:18.470
<i>Now I'll crush</i>
<i>your favorite toy with you inside it.</i>

00:18:19.180 --> 00:18:20.220
Not today.

00:18:30.100 --> 00:18:32.820
Very persistent, my old friend.

00:18:33.110 --> 00:18:34.230
<i>Locked on target.</i>

00:18:34.320 --> 00:18:36.240
<i>You know what I like best about you?</i>

00:18:36.320 --> 00:18:37.990
<i>You're so predictable.</i>

00:18:43.330 --> 00:18:46.410
Bat on a stick.
What are you gonna do?

00:18:46.500 --> 00:18:47.750
Not so fast.

00:19:06.720 --> 00:19:08.730
Stop that monster, Joker!

00:19:08.850 --> 00:19:11.940
I could stop, but is it alright?

00:19:19.740 --> 00:19:20.860
If I stop now,

00:19:20.950 --> 00:19:24.490
that mother and child down below
will be squished.

00:19:24.580 --> 00:19:26.490
Are you okay with that, Bats?

00:19:51.230 --> 00:19:52.850
Bane!

00:19:54.690 --> 00:19:56.320
Bane? How did you--

00:19:56.400 --> 00:19:59.440
<i>Dosukoi!</i>

00:20:27.510 --> 00:20:28.930
This isn't your fight!

00:20:39.360 --> 00:20:40.440
Go. Hurry!

00:20:42.780 --> 00:20:44.240
Need more power.

00:20:47.780 --> 00:20:48.990
Wait! No!

00:20:58.750 --> 00:21:00.710
Get moving, I'll hold them off.

00:21:01.380 --> 00:21:03.170
Hold this!

00:21:12.180 --> 00:21:15.730
Poor Bats. He always
falls for the same tricks.

00:21:16.350 --> 00:21:18.730
Being a hero is not easy, huh?

00:21:18.810 --> 00:21:22.230
He's always risking his life
to save ordinary people.

00:21:22.440 --> 00:21:24.950
If you had just let them die
and gone after me instead,

00:21:25.030 --> 00:21:28.570
maybe you wouldn't
find yourself in such terrible shape.

00:21:29.200 --> 00:21:30.530
Talk as you like.

00:21:31.040 --> 00:21:32.870
Well, what shall we do now?

00:21:32.950 --> 00:21:36.290
How are you going
to entertain me some more?

00:21:36.830 --> 00:21:40.040
I'm not here for your entertainment.

00:21:40.130 --> 00:21:42.090
I like how you act tough.

00:21:42.300 --> 00:21:45.930
Now that all your toys are busted.

00:21:46.010 --> 00:21:47.430
What do you have left?

00:21:47.510 --> 00:21:50.810
If only your friends
were around to come by and say hi.

00:21:51.100 --> 00:21:52.930
Mr. J, look!

00:21:59.810 --> 00:22:01.730
I was being sarcastic!

00:22:07.200 --> 00:22:09.280
<i>Multiple Batmen?</i>

00:22:12.080 --> 00:22:13.120
We got you.

00:22:36.520 --> 00:22:37.980
Nightwing, Red Robin,

00:22:38.600 --> 00:22:39.980
who else made the time jump?

00:22:40.400 --> 00:22:42.150
Red Hood and Robin, too.

00:22:42.570 --> 00:22:44.570
But Red Hood is away on a recon mission

00:22:44.650 --> 00:22:46.860
to find out what's happening
in the other feudal states.

00:22:47.780 --> 00:22:48.950
Alfred and Catwoman?

00:22:49.280 --> 00:22:50.320
Don't worry.

00:22:50.660 --> 00:22:52.030
Robin has already gone after them.

00:22:52.410 --> 00:22:54.160
They should be here shortly.

00:22:55.200 --> 00:22:56.250
And them?

00:22:57.080 --> 00:22:58.750
They are Japanese Ninja.

00:22:59.370 --> 00:23:03.210
He was a great help to us
after we arrived here.

00:23:03.920 --> 00:23:05.050
<i>Ninja?</i>

00:23:05.800 --> 00:23:08.090
We are the Bat Clan of Hida.

00:23:08.380 --> 00:23:12.180
Our lives are guided
by an ancient prophecy.

00:23:20.020 --> 00:23:23.310
<i>Legend foretells that</i>
<i>when the country is in chaos</i>

00:23:23.560 --> 00:23:27.280
<i>a foreign ninja wearing</i>
<i>the mask of a bat will come</i>

00:23:27.360 --> 00:23:29.030
<i>and restore order to our land.</i>

00:23:29.900 --> 00:23:34.410
<i>Bat Clan, serve this shinobi </i>
<i>with your life.</i>

00:23:35.280 --> 00:23:38.750
<i>This is the hour of our destiny.</i>

00:23:47.300 --> 00:23:49.510
We have waited
all our lives for this moment,

00:23:49.920 --> 00:23:52.800
great shinobi from
across the sea of time.

00:23:52.890 --> 00:23:54.090
Lord Batman.

00:24:29.130 --> 00:24:30.510
Looks like a nice place.

00:24:30.960 --> 00:24:32.420
Yes, but for how long.

00:24:33.380 --> 00:24:35.800
The Batmobile,
the Batwing, we don't have them.

00:24:36.970 --> 00:24:39.850
We can't use any devices
from the 21st century here.

00:24:41.060 --> 00:24:43.690
Joker has bigger forces.

00:24:48.690 --> 00:24:49.570
Batman.

00:24:49.690 --> 00:24:51.070
Monkichi has a message for you.

00:24:51.240 --> 00:24:52.280
Monkichi?

00:24:52.400 --> 00:24:54.660
It's weird, but Robin's
made friends with this monkey.

00:24:54.780 --> 00:24:56.240
He's pretty smart.

00:24:56.410 --> 00:24:58.490
And he understands everything I say.

00:25:00.620 --> 00:25:01.580
<i>A letter?</i>

00:25:01.660 --> 00:25:03.790
He says he got it from
someone in the mountain.

00:25:05.960 --> 00:25:07.210
It's in English.

00:25:09.380 --> 00:25:10.460
It's Grodd.

00:25:26.480 --> 00:25:28.480
ENLIGHTENMENT

00:25:49.130 --> 00:25:52.460
What is it about apes and humans,

00:25:52.670 --> 00:25:56.550
that we always sigh
when we relax in a hot bath, Batman?

00:25:57.550 --> 00:26:00.180
<i>You might as well enjoy the water, too.</i>

00:26:01.010 --> 00:26:02.720
No, I'm good right here.

00:26:03.850 --> 00:26:08.400
It won't be bad for a hero and a villain
to enjoy hot spring together.

00:26:08.480 --> 00:26:11.480
Are you sure
you don't want to reconsider?

00:26:14.360 --> 00:26:17.820
<i>I'm guessing you didn't invite me here</i>
<i>just to join you for a hot soak.</i>

00:26:18.740 --> 00:26:20.450
Such impatience.

00:26:21.580 --> 00:26:24.540
We're only in this mess
because of your invention.

00:26:24.790 --> 00:26:28.120
Why did you invent
that time machine in the first place?

00:26:28.790 --> 00:26:32.090
It was just an experiment
of the Quake Engine.

00:26:32.840 --> 00:26:35.550
The criminals of Gotham
were my guinea pigs.

00:26:35.630 --> 00:26:37.880
I gathered only the bad men.

00:26:39.300 --> 00:26:41.850
I was going to send them
some place far away,

00:26:41.930 --> 00:26:43.720
that was my purpose.

00:26:45.100 --> 00:26:51.060
<i>But your interference</i>
<i>brought us to this time and place.</i>

00:26:51.270 --> 00:26:52.230
How's that?

00:26:52.980 --> 00:26:56.110
We are both responsible for
what transpired that night.

00:26:58.110 --> 00:27:00.530
I won't fight a losing battle, Batman.

00:27:01.320 --> 00:27:02.990
I will cooperate.

00:27:03.660 --> 00:27:04.700
I heard you.

00:27:05.120 --> 00:27:07.040
You will be the bait.

00:27:08.870 --> 00:27:09.920
<i>Intriguing.</i>

00:27:39.780 --> 00:27:42.870
Well, it's been a while,
my dear Gorilla Grodd.

00:27:42.990 --> 00:27:45.450
Looks like this place agrees with you.

00:27:45.870 --> 00:27:49.330
You look like a hermit already.

00:27:49.450 --> 00:27:50.750
That's funny.

00:27:50.960 --> 00:27:54.080
You are the funny one. Are you seriously
trying to be the King here?

00:27:54.170 --> 00:27:56.460
King? What are you talking about?

00:27:56.590 --> 00:27:58.920
All I care about is my own pleasure.

00:27:59.010 --> 00:28:01.880
Imagine this entire country
in total chaos.

00:28:01.970 --> 00:28:05.350
A land full of
needless suffering and pain.

00:28:06.390 --> 00:28:08.600
It's very interesting
that of all humans,

00:28:08.680 --> 00:28:11.060
you're the one who wound up
with the Quake Engine.

00:28:11.140 --> 00:28:13.850
I'm tired of all this chit-chat, Grodd.

00:28:14.020 --> 00:28:16.820
I told you I'd spare your life
in exchange for the Batman.

00:28:16.940 --> 00:28:18.440
So where is he?

00:28:22.150 --> 00:28:23.280
Right here.

00:28:28.700 --> 00:28:30.790
We have you surrounded, Joker.

00:28:32.210 --> 00:28:33.330
You sure do.

00:28:48.470 --> 00:28:49.510
Catch!

00:28:53.980 --> 00:28:58.480
We knew you'd have men
hiding in the water.

00:28:58.770 --> 00:29:01.030
It's a shame they all had to die.

00:29:01.320 --> 00:29:03.530
So why don't you join them?

00:29:06.700 --> 00:29:07.820
Maybe another time.

00:29:17.380 --> 00:29:19.500
You're still doomed.

00:29:27.050 --> 00:29:30.060
You underestimate your opponent, Joker.

00:29:31.390 --> 00:29:32.980
It can dive too.

00:29:33.680 --> 00:29:35.850
But how? We killed you.

00:29:39.190 --> 00:29:41.820
Ever heard of a decoy?

00:30:23.030 --> 00:30:27.320
Sheesh. I never figured you'd side
with Batman, Gorilla Grodd.

00:30:27.400 --> 00:30:29.450
Anything to gain the advantage.

00:31:18.960 --> 00:31:23.130
I never thought you'd need help
from a talking monkey to catch me.

00:31:23.250 --> 00:31:25.380
I'm so embarrassed for you, Batman.

00:31:25.590 --> 00:31:28.300
Don't be. I'm happy to disappoint.

00:31:28.970 --> 00:31:32.590
I'd be careful.
If he turned on me, he'll turn on you.

00:31:32.930 --> 00:31:36.260
You should know this Gorilla has
odd power.

00:31:36.520 --> 00:31:39.520
Good job, Batman and friends.

00:31:39.890 --> 00:31:41.100
Many thanks.

00:31:41.400 --> 00:31:43.610
You are my friends, too.

00:31:44.860 --> 00:31:48.240
Now you will submit to my control.

00:31:48.530 --> 00:31:51.150
Bat Clan, destroy them all.

00:31:56.660 --> 00:31:59.080
We cannot be shaken
by your evil thoughts.

00:31:59.160 --> 00:32:02.460
We have mastery
over our bodies and our minds.

00:32:02.750 --> 00:32:03.920
So you do.

00:32:04.420 --> 00:32:06.670
Then prepare to be annihilated.

00:32:18.680 --> 00:32:19.720
Over there!

00:32:25.980 --> 00:32:27.150
<i>Two-Face.</i>

00:32:27.940 --> 00:32:30.490
You and Two-Face
have teamed up, Gorilla Grodd?

00:32:31.490 --> 00:32:32.820
That's right.

00:32:35.620 --> 00:32:39.290
Don't you know Gorilla Grodd
is always two steps ahead?

00:32:44.500 --> 00:32:45.540
Our ship!

00:32:45.630 --> 00:32:46.670
No!

00:32:49.670 --> 00:32:53.050
Cats have a good intuition as I expected.

00:32:55.550 --> 00:32:58.470
I thought you might want this thingy.

00:32:58.890 --> 00:33:01.270
Now, where did you get that?

00:33:01.390 --> 00:33:03.810
I lifted it from
Harley Quinn during our fight.

00:33:04.390 --> 00:33:07.400
It's part of your
fancy Quake machine, isn't it?

00:33:08.480 --> 00:33:10.110
And what do you want in return?

00:33:10.940 --> 00:33:12.820
Take me back to the future.

00:33:15.110 --> 00:33:16.160
It's a deal.

00:33:16.740 --> 00:33:18.280
I thought we could do business.

00:33:27.460 --> 00:33:28.500
Damn!

00:33:30.800 --> 00:33:31.840
Joker?

00:33:32.170 --> 00:33:34.010
Looking for me, Bats?

00:33:37.390 --> 00:33:38.430
Don't do it, Joker.

00:33:39.760 --> 00:33:42.770
We need to go! She can't
stay afloat much longer.

00:33:42.970 --> 00:33:44.480
Take the others, go!

00:33:44.560 --> 00:33:45.480
What about you?

00:33:45.560 --> 00:33:47.520
I'm staying. He's not getting away.

00:33:47.810 --> 00:33:50.020
I'm really flattered, Batman.

00:33:50.150 --> 00:33:54.280
We've been cheated by the Gorilla dude.

00:33:54.490 --> 00:33:56.660
To be honest,
if Two-Face had killed you,

00:33:56.740 --> 00:33:58.320
I'd never forgive myself.

00:33:58.530 --> 00:34:02.040
I deserve to kill the Batman.

00:34:02.160 --> 00:34:04.500
Joker! You're insane.

00:34:04.660 --> 00:34:07.500
Let's go to hell, Bats.

00:34:07.580 --> 00:34:09.920
<i>We are having a party, in hell!</i>

00:34:16.470 --> 00:34:17.970
No!

00:34:28.350 --> 00:34:30.110
Destroyed?

00:34:54.170 --> 00:34:56.300
TROJAN BIRDMAN CASTLE

00:34:58.680 --> 00:35:02.180
JUROKU PLANT POISON CASTLE

00:35:05.770 --> 00:35:09.140
GAKUJU SHARASO CASTLE

00:35:13.770 --> 00:35:16.690
FUDO OMOTE TWO-FACE CASTLE

00:35:21.320 --> 00:35:24.990
ARKHAM CASTLE

00:35:32.880 --> 00:35:34.710
The renovations are almost complete.

00:35:35.090 --> 00:35:36.710
Contact the other daimyos.

00:35:36.800 --> 00:35:39.300
The battle will be
at Jigokukohara, The Field of Hell.

00:35:39.380 --> 00:35:41.090
Let them know.

00:35:41.260 --> 00:35:42.090
You got it.

00:35:43.800 --> 00:35:45.560
<i>And when will we be going home?</i>

00:35:45.810 --> 00:35:46.640
Not yet.

00:35:46.890 --> 00:35:48.730
<i>We still need to obtain</i>
<i>three remaining power converters</i>

00:35:48.810 --> 00:35:51.100
<i>from Penguin, Poison Ivy,</i>
<i>and Deathstroke.</i>

00:35:51.230 --> 00:35:57.730
<i>Then the Quake Engine will be complete</i>
<i>and we can move through time and space.</i>

00:35:59.240 --> 00:36:01.570
<i>Excuse me, do you mind stepping aside?</i>

00:36:03.820 --> 00:36:06.240
Where did you find the banana?

00:36:06.450 --> 00:36:08.950
It was a gift from Westerners.

00:36:32.310 --> 00:36:34.520
We're relieved
you're with us, Master Bruce.

00:36:35.060 --> 00:36:36.230
How long have I been out?

00:36:36.860 --> 00:36:38.480
Two whole days, sir.

00:36:39.530 --> 00:36:40.570
I see.

00:36:42.740 --> 00:36:43.780
Well, what is this?

00:36:44.530 --> 00:36:46.780
Eian brought it by, sir.

00:36:47.160 --> 00:36:49.990
He said the legendary mask
of the Bat Clan

00:36:50.120 --> 00:36:52.750
should be worn by its rightful owner.

00:37:17.310 --> 00:37:20.650
I thought I had nothing...

00:37:22.110 --> 00:37:24.400
...to fight against Joker in this era.

00:37:25.240 --> 00:37:28.160
No Batcave or
the newest device.

00:37:29.910 --> 00:37:32.700
In my desperation,
I joined forces with Grodd.

00:37:35.290 --> 00:37:38.540
So many lost and injured
because I was blind

00:37:38.630 --> 00:37:41.210
to Grodd's betrayal,
but ultimately to myself.

00:37:43.090 --> 00:37:46.050
And yet they still insist
on calling me Master.

00:37:46.970 --> 00:37:48.090
So what are you gonna do?

00:37:48.550 --> 00:37:49.600
Just hang it up?

00:37:50.180 --> 00:37:52.350
Me, giving up?

00:37:52.720 --> 00:37:53.770
You are joking.

00:37:54.600 --> 00:37:57.310
I was wrong.

00:37:58.770 --> 00:38:02.070
I lost because I thought I had nothing.

00:38:06.320 --> 00:38:07.360
I still have...

00:38:08.320 --> 00:38:10.200
...this body.

00:38:21.500 --> 00:38:24.130
I have the will to fight.

00:38:25.510 --> 00:38:28.510
And I have you and bat clan.

00:38:30.640 --> 00:38:32.470
That's all I need.

00:38:34.310 --> 00:38:37.350
This time period has its own strength.

00:38:37.440 --> 00:38:39.020
We will harness the ability.

00:38:40.810 --> 00:38:41.900
Let's begin.

00:38:41.980 --> 00:38:44.190
We are gonna win no matter what.

00:38:46.190 --> 00:38:47.700
BAT'S VILLAGE

00:38:49.240 --> 00:38:50.280
TRAINING CAMP

00:38:50.370 --> 00:38:52.830
The techniques of the ninja
are extremely effective.

00:38:53.540 --> 00:38:55.540
If we can combine
their martial arts skills

00:38:55.620 --> 00:38:58.000
with modern innovations and combat,
Grodd won't know what hit him.

00:38:58.580 --> 00:39:00.790
If they attack us with
their mobile fortress,

00:39:00.880 --> 00:39:02.750
we will out-maneuver them.

00:39:03.340 --> 00:39:04.380
Will it work?

00:39:04.460 --> 00:39:06.760
The craftsmanship
of the ninja blacksmiths is incredible.

00:39:06.840 --> 00:39:08.590
The precision of their weapons
can't be matched

00:39:08.680 --> 00:39:10.800
even by our 21st century standards.

00:39:15.390 --> 00:39:18.060
I've got fresh ingredients.

00:39:18.140 --> 00:39:19.560
I'm planning a high protein diet.

00:39:19.640 --> 00:39:22.520
Perhaps some boar steak
for dinner tonight, sir?

00:39:22.650 --> 00:39:23.820
Sounds good, Alfred.

00:39:23.900 --> 00:39:27.780
When the wheat is ready for harvest,
we can make some freshly baked bread.

00:39:28.900 --> 00:39:30.530
Something is wrong?

00:39:30.660 --> 00:39:33.070
Thank you, Alfred.

00:39:33.160 --> 00:39:34.160
Hey!

00:39:34.240 --> 00:39:36.410
Batman, Monkichi has another message.

00:39:36.490 --> 00:39:37.580
Found them?

00:39:37.700 --> 00:39:39.040
Yes. Red Hood did.

00:39:39.370 --> 00:39:40.460
I'm on my way.

00:40:19.620 --> 00:40:21.960
May I have a cup of water, please?

00:40:22.420 --> 00:40:23.880
Yes, of course.

00:40:26.210 --> 00:40:28.340
You must be exhausted.

00:40:33.930 --> 00:40:37.470
It's a rather hot day
for a Buddhist monk to be traveling.

00:40:40.890 --> 00:40:43.480
What on earth are you doing?

00:40:43.600 --> 00:40:45.400
I'll break it.

00:40:46.060 --> 00:40:47.070
Honey!

00:40:48.940 --> 00:40:50.740
Stop! Please stop!

00:40:51.110 --> 00:40:53.990
Shut up and show your face.
I'll break her arm.

00:40:57.910 --> 00:41:00.040
<i>I knew you were alive.</i>

00:41:01.330 --> 00:41:02.330
Joker!

00:41:04.210 --> 00:41:07.790
They said you were dead,
but I didn't believe it.

00:41:08.250 --> 00:41:10.170
So I've been looking for you.

00:41:10.590 --> 00:41:11.630
Joker?

00:41:11.970 --> 00:41:14.090
Is that my name?

00:41:14.220 --> 00:41:15.550
Admit it!

00:41:16.800 --> 00:41:19.890
No! No! My darling!
Are you alright?

00:41:20.850 --> 00:41:22.850
No, no, are you insane?

00:41:23.770 --> 00:41:26.270
It's too suspicious, don't you think?

00:41:26.600 --> 00:41:28.230
Do you expect me to believe

00:41:28.310 --> 00:41:30.440
the Joker has taken up farming?

00:41:30.860 --> 00:41:32.360
Honey?

00:41:32.570 --> 00:41:34.700
You, too, Harley Quinn!

00:41:35.280 --> 00:41:37.410
My love. My love.

00:41:37.990 --> 00:41:41.950
<i>Please forgive us. Please. Please.</i>

00:41:56.340 --> 00:41:57.970
I'm not lying.

00:41:58.050 --> 00:42:00.350
I'm not who you think I am.

00:42:00.430 --> 00:42:02.890
If you're still going to deny it...

00:42:21.120 --> 00:42:22.790
<i>Red Hood, stop it!</i>

00:42:23.830 --> 00:42:26.500
<i>Batman, what are you doing here?</i>

00:42:27.420 --> 00:42:28.540
<i>Same as you.</i>

00:42:30.790 --> 00:42:33.840
I heard that you had found
the Joker and Harley.

00:42:34.010 --> 00:42:37.680
Reports of foreign farmers in the area
match their description.

00:42:50.190 --> 00:42:52.070
<i>So, you don't remember anything?</i>

00:42:52.400 --> 00:42:53.480
<i>No. </i>

00:42:54.280 --> 00:42:57.400
We can't remember
anything about our past.

00:42:57.490 --> 00:43:00.870
We came here to live
a peaceful life, deep in the mountains.

00:43:01.320 --> 00:43:05.950
My wife and I,
we plough the fields together.

00:43:06.910 --> 00:43:07.830
<i>I see.</i>

00:43:07.960 --> 00:43:09.920
Don't let 'em fool you, Batman.

00:43:10.120 --> 00:43:11.960
They're up to their same old tricks.

00:43:12.630 --> 00:43:14.250
I'm not so sure, Red Hood.

00:43:17.130 --> 00:43:18.670
<i>I'm sorry for my friend's behavior.</i>

00:43:29.310 --> 00:43:32.860
When I work the land,
I feel like I'm being cleansed.

00:43:33.110 --> 00:43:36.360
It's as if everything bad
inside me is being sucked out

00:43:36.440 --> 00:43:38.820
and absorbed back into the earth.

00:43:39.700 --> 00:43:42.120
I know it sounds silly,
but my wife and I are always saying

00:43:42.240 --> 00:43:44.030
it's like we've been reborn.

00:43:45.450 --> 00:43:48.540
<i>Honey, quick! Come look!</i>

00:43:48.910 --> 00:43:52.630
<i>There's a sprout. You have to see this.</i>
<i>New life coming out of the ground.</i>

00:43:53.170 --> 00:43:55.880
A sprout, are you kidding?

00:43:55.960 --> 00:43:57.000
Enough.

00:43:57.840 --> 00:44:00.720
This is different.
I've been tricked by them before.

00:44:02.430 --> 00:44:04.640
<i>There isn't</i>
<i>the same madness in his eyes.</i>

00:44:05.560 --> 00:44:06.810
<i>If you knew him like I did,</i>

00:44:06.970 --> 00:44:09.310
<i>you'd know he could never hide</i>
<i>that part of himself.</i>

00:44:09.390 --> 00:44:11.350
<i>It's what makes him what he is.</i>

00:44:21.110 --> 00:44:22.490
My love!

00:44:23.110 --> 00:44:24.240
Honey.

00:44:27.080 --> 00:44:29.910
We did it. They're finally growing.

00:44:33.080 --> 00:44:34.170
Bruce...

00:44:35.040 --> 00:44:37.380
He's not the Joker.
At least, not anymore.

00:44:38.000 --> 00:44:39.960
They are just farmers.

00:44:40.380 --> 00:44:42.380
There's no need to bother them.

00:44:42.510 --> 00:44:43.680
You can't be serious.

00:44:46.050 --> 00:44:48.060
<i>We'll take them back with us</i>

00:44:48.140 --> 00:44:50.100
once the Quake Engine
is operational again.

00:44:51.060 --> 00:44:53.690
But for now we'll just
keep an eye on them.

00:44:55.230 --> 00:44:57.060
<i>Come on, Red Hood, let's go.</i>

00:45:06.620 --> 00:45:08.030
It's okay now.

00:45:43.110 --> 00:45:44.740
The time has arrived

00:45:45.360 --> 00:45:49.330
to destroy these upstarts
and rebuild the Quake Engine.

00:45:51.540 --> 00:45:53.910
Arkham Castle, rise!

00:46:31.280 --> 00:46:34.370
This country is the land of gold,

00:46:34.540 --> 00:46:38.040
all of it is mine.

00:46:41.000 --> 00:46:44.130
Fly, Trojan Birdman Castle.

00:46:44.300 --> 00:46:45.760
Spread your wings!

00:46:47.720 --> 00:46:49.970
I will not let
this paradise be destroyed

00:46:50.050 --> 00:46:52.050
by the machinations of men.

00:46:52.510 --> 00:46:54.560
Juroku Plant Poison Castle.

00:46:55.180 --> 00:46:56.390
Grow!

00:47:01.150 --> 00:47:02.440
<i>Interesting.</i>

00:47:02.820 --> 00:47:06.440
Now we'll finally see who's
the most powerful warlord in Japan.

00:47:07.360 --> 00:47:11.120
Gakuju Sharaso Castle will blow
you all to kingdom come.

00:47:15.240 --> 00:47:16.910
From order to chaos.

00:47:18.620 --> 00:47:20.920
The enemy converges
at The Field of Hell.

00:47:21.170 --> 00:47:23.630
<i>Fudo Omote Two-Face Castle is now</i>

00:47:24.460 --> 00:47:25.920
<i>taking the field.</i>

00:47:48.110 --> 00:47:49.450
A fine tea, Alfred.

00:47:50.650 --> 00:47:51.700
My pleasure.

00:47:53.070 --> 00:47:56.620
All of the daimyo castles
are on the move.

00:47:58.250 --> 00:48:01.080
Castles are on the move...
They've got to be kidding.

00:48:02.370 --> 00:48:05.800
The Field of Hell will be the
final battlefield.

00:48:06.840 --> 00:48:08.130
But what matters is

00:48:08.210 --> 00:48:11.050
the converters and the Quake Engine
will all be in one place.

00:48:12.590 --> 00:48:14.260
This is the last chance.

00:48:14.890 --> 00:48:16.510
We will defeat them at once,

00:48:16.760 --> 00:48:19.060
and take the Quake Engine in our hands.

00:48:22.940 --> 00:48:25.690
<i>Remember, the machines,</i>
<i>no matter how large,</i>

00:48:25.940 --> 00:48:27.860
are still controlled by humans.

00:48:28.190 --> 00:48:30.900
If we attack the spot,
then we have a fighting chance.

00:48:32.740 --> 00:48:34.370
<i>They call me Master.</i>

00:48:34.450 --> 00:48:38.290
I must make Bat clan's wishes come true.

00:48:44.670 --> 00:48:49.880
<i>I am the legendary ninja</i>
<i>who will bring peace to their land.</i>

00:49:09.570 --> 00:49:10.780
<i>Fire!</i>

00:49:17.490 --> 00:49:21.330
This Penguin moves
as swiftly on land as it does at sea!

00:49:21.500 --> 00:49:23.910
<i>And it's got one hell of a bite.</i>

00:49:25.000 --> 00:49:28.250
Watch it, you greedy bloated bird.

00:49:28.340 --> 00:49:30.750
Do you think you can defeat me?

00:49:35.720 --> 00:49:37.720
<i>Trojan Birdman Castle,</i>

00:49:37.890 --> 00:49:41.930
<i>wind, forest, fire,</i>
<i>mountain transformation.</i>

00:49:42.350 --> 00:49:44.020
We are thinking the same thing.

00:49:45.980 --> 00:49:47.900
<i>Juroku Plant Poison Castle,</i>

00:49:47.980 --> 00:49:50.730
<i>multitudes of flowers transformation.</i>

00:49:55.860 --> 00:49:56.990
Bullseye.

00:49:58.030 --> 00:49:58.950
<i>Gakuju Sharaso Castle,</i>

00:49:59.030 --> 00:50:02.200
<i>rapid fire 100 cannons transformation.</i>

00:50:02.370 --> 00:50:03.410
<i>Fire!</i>

00:50:18.050 --> 00:50:19.390
Not too bad.

00:50:31.860 --> 00:50:35.030
Gorilla Grodd, leave him to me.

00:50:39.780 --> 00:50:41.330
<i>Fudo Omote Two-Face Castle,</i>

00:50:41.450 --> 00:50:44.620
<i>two-faced transformation!</i>

00:50:49.830 --> 00:50:51.290
Look! Over there.

00:50:51.540 --> 00:50:53.210
Castles fighting?

00:50:59.680 --> 00:51:00.760
Batman!

00:51:06.180 --> 00:51:07.940
Batman, what now?

00:51:08.060 --> 00:51:10.940
Master, leave them to us.

00:51:11.360 --> 00:51:12.400
Give 'em hell!

00:51:16.570 --> 00:51:17.740
Behind us.

00:51:19.490 --> 00:51:21.660
We're stuck between
a rock and a hard place.

00:51:32.920 --> 00:51:33.960
Come on.

00:51:50.480 --> 00:51:53.270
Are you serving as my shield?

00:51:53.860 --> 00:51:56.940
Sure. Until the coin tells me otherwise.

00:52:04.370 --> 00:52:05.910
Not your shield...

00:52:06.660 --> 00:52:07.830
I'm the blade.

00:52:07.950 --> 00:52:11.040
I'm gonna rip you limb from limb, Grodd!

00:52:14.290 --> 00:52:17.920
I could read your
superficial obedience.

00:52:18.210 --> 00:52:21.300
I knew it was only a matter of time.

00:52:23.550 --> 00:52:24.600
Let's go!

00:52:32.390 --> 00:52:34.650
Head straight for Arkham Castle!

00:52:40.400 --> 00:52:41.450
Look out!

00:52:53.920 --> 00:52:56.340
Stupid people.

00:53:19.070 --> 00:53:23.490
It's time to get down to business.

00:53:57.730 --> 00:53:59.980
BRAINWASHED

00:54:03.990 --> 00:54:05.650
What are you doing now?

00:54:05.820 --> 00:54:09.950
All of Gotham's criminals
are now under my mind control.

00:54:10.870 --> 00:54:11.990
BIRDMAN

00:54:13.290 --> 00:54:17.370
What they do not know
is that I actually manipulated them...

00:54:17.460 --> 00:54:18.290
PLANT POISON

00:54:18.380 --> 00:54:20.340
...into building their fortresses, too.

00:54:21.210 --> 00:54:22.050
TWO FACE

00:54:22.130 --> 00:54:23.760
They are just pieces in a larger puzzle,

00:54:23.840 --> 00:54:26.550
taking actions as I want them to.

00:54:28.180 --> 00:54:30.010
Whatever it takes to get home.

00:54:30.850 --> 00:54:32.510
I'm sorry, Catwoman.

00:54:33.680 --> 00:54:35.060
GOKUJU SHARASO - BIRDMAN
TWO FACE - PLANT POISON

00:54:35.140 --> 00:54:37.640
I'm going to rule this country

00:54:37.730 --> 00:54:40.940
and turn it into a kingdom of monkeys.

00:54:41.940 --> 00:54:45.860
Criminals of Gotham,
you may become one now.

00:54:59.330 --> 00:55:00.500
What is...

00:55:06.470 --> 00:55:07.590
MONKEY KING

00:55:22.730 --> 00:55:24.480
We're back!

00:55:25.480 --> 00:55:26.990
I love giving presents.

00:55:27.070 --> 00:55:28.740
Why don't you take it?

00:55:29.280 --> 00:55:31.910
In with demons,

00:55:31.990 --> 00:55:33.870
out with luck!

00:55:35.080 --> 00:55:36.910
-Joker?
-It can't be.

00:55:37.040 --> 00:55:38.250
Hi, Bats.

00:55:38.870 --> 00:55:42.830
You should know by now
that you can't keep a crazy man down.

00:55:51.550 --> 00:55:54.350
You never want to be
too early to a party.

00:55:54.470 --> 00:55:55.510
Right?

00:55:58.890 --> 00:56:00.810
Hi, pretty kitty.

00:56:01.350 --> 00:56:05.020
You really took us by surprise
back at the lake, Grodd.

00:56:05.190 --> 00:56:08.280
But now it's time for a little payback.

00:56:08.490 --> 00:56:10.780
The paralysis from this flower
isn't permanent.

00:56:10.860 --> 00:56:12.360
How do you like it?

00:56:12.530 --> 00:56:14.620
Ivy's got the best plants,
don't you think?

00:56:14.830 --> 00:56:16.120
Bastard.

00:56:16.290 --> 00:56:19.370
Now, now, now,
don't go and strain yourself.

00:56:19.500 --> 00:56:21.620
Not that you can move anyway.

00:56:21.750 --> 00:56:23.710
You too, kitty cat.

00:56:27.170 --> 00:56:31.090
Now, in a dramatic turn of events,
the Joker takes over Grodd's plan.

00:56:31.340 --> 00:56:32.470
You, monkey!

00:56:39.310 --> 00:56:40.350
Batman!

00:57:01.910 --> 00:57:03.920
It's so tough being a hero.

00:57:15.050 --> 00:57:16.600
Are both of you all right?

00:57:17.850 --> 00:57:20.810
Don't think I didn't notice you
saving Grodd before me.

00:57:21.180 --> 00:57:23.100
But thank you, Batman.

00:57:24.270 --> 00:57:27.060
I see that gas
didn't knock out your attitude.

00:57:27.230 --> 00:57:29.070
You won't need an antidote.

00:57:31.570 --> 00:57:33.740
GAKUJU SHARASO - TWO FACE
PLANT POISON - BIRDMAN

00:57:34.030 --> 00:57:37.410
It looks like this thing is
still plugged into their brains.

00:57:38.080 --> 00:57:41.450
Well, that means it's time
to play a few mind games.

00:57:45.460 --> 00:57:47.380
Criminals of Gotham,

00:57:48.790 --> 00:57:51.300
become one!

00:57:52.090 --> 00:57:53.670
JOKER - TRANSFORMATION

00:58:40.680 --> 00:58:46.020
Five unite and serve
as six heavenly beings.

00:58:46.100 --> 00:58:48.690
Lord Joker!

00:58:59.410 --> 00:59:01.280
That thing's enormous.

00:59:02.700 --> 00:59:06.660
This contraption is better
than I ever imagined, Gorilla Grodd.

00:59:07.330 --> 00:59:10.540
I'm gonna play a lot with this guy.

00:59:11.000 --> 00:59:12.090
This country...

00:59:12.210 --> 00:59:15.510
...really will belong the Joker.

00:59:23.430 --> 00:59:24.890
Hurry, get out of here.

00:59:40.700 --> 00:59:41.870
Robin, get--

00:59:44.450 --> 00:59:45.490
Robin!

00:59:53.710 --> 00:59:55.170
<i>Gorilla Grodd?</i>

00:59:58.880 --> 01:00:00.720
<i>That was easy. Now what?</i>

01:00:09.140 --> 01:00:10.560
Guess I could use a nap.

01:00:14.190 --> 01:00:15.270
So what now?

01:00:15.820 --> 01:00:17.150
He's hurt pretty bad.

01:00:19.490 --> 01:00:20.530
Batman.

01:00:23.570 --> 01:00:24.990
You can use this.

01:00:29.040 --> 01:00:32.420
It controls my army of monkeys.

01:00:33.420 --> 01:00:37.210
Use them to defeat the Joker.

01:00:39.550 --> 01:00:42.470
I owe you for saving my life.

01:00:43.390 --> 01:00:45.930
I promise, no tricks this time.

01:00:52.390 --> 01:00:55.520
Batman, lend us the flute, please?

01:00:56.270 --> 01:00:58.320
Monkichi and I know exactly what to do.

01:01:14.120 --> 01:01:15.170
What?

01:01:25.840 --> 01:01:27.010
There's millions.

01:01:44.070 --> 01:01:45.700
What the...

01:01:46.990 --> 01:01:49.160
<i>Get off! Tickles!</i>

01:01:49.280 --> 01:01:50.790
<i>Stop!</i>

01:01:53.500 --> 01:01:54.540
They can't hang on.

01:01:56.460 --> 01:01:57.500
Monmi.

01:01:57.750 --> 01:01:58.670
Who's she?

01:02:00.050 --> 01:02:01.090
You got it.

01:02:01.710 --> 01:02:02.920
So annoying!

01:02:33.160 --> 01:02:36.040
If the bad guys are going to unite,
then so will we.

01:02:37.870 --> 01:02:39.250
Enough monkeying around!

01:02:39.580 --> 01:02:41.460
<i>I'll blow you to pieces.</i>

01:02:53.930 --> 01:02:58.600
<i>All for one and one for all.</i>

01:02:59.190 --> 01:03:02.570
Their combined spirit
has formed this giant monkey.

01:03:03.400 --> 01:03:06.030
Now, witness
the awesome power of the monkeys.

01:03:15.910 --> 01:03:16.960
Let's move!

01:03:17.370 --> 01:03:19.500
Storm the robot while it's down.

01:03:19.620 --> 01:03:20.500
Right!

01:03:20.750 --> 01:03:23.130
Monkichi!
I'm leaving the flute with you.

01:03:24.670 --> 01:03:26.590
Bruce, I'm going with you.

01:03:26.760 --> 01:03:29.220
Harley Quinn could use
a good ass-kicking.

01:03:30.890 --> 01:03:31.930
Come on.

01:03:32.010 --> 01:03:35.140
Got to love a man who can forgive a girl
for double-crossing him.

01:03:37.480 --> 01:03:40.060
What entertainment.

01:03:46.280 --> 01:03:50.200
<i>Too bad.</i>

01:03:56.330 --> 01:03:57.370
All right.

01:03:59.290 --> 01:04:00.120
ENLARGED

01:04:00.210 --> 01:04:01.960
Looks like more monkey business.

01:04:02.080 --> 01:04:04.670
Harley, we have guests.

01:04:05.750 --> 01:04:08.420
Why don't you greet them
with a warm kiss?

01:04:08.510 --> 01:04:09.720
Sure.

01:04:18.060 --> 01:04:19.100
Get down!

01:04:41.750 --> 01:04:43.630
-Robin.
-No!

01:05:01.230 --> 01:05:03.350
Master, at your service.

01:05:13.990 --> 01:05:17.620
I hate bats!
Get out of here, you stupid bats!

01:05:17.910 --> 01:05:19.410
Go! Go!

01:05:35.390 --> 01:05:37.470
Bats?

01:05:50.400 --> 01:05:53.150
Behold, the mighty Batgod before us.

01:05:58.070 --> 01:06:00.160
Bats! Harley?

01:06:00.240 --> 01:06:01.580
Yes, sir!

01:06:01.700 --> 01:06:04.830
Turn on The Field of Hell!

01:06:22.390 --> 01:06:23.680
We're coming for you.

01:07:07.140 --> 01:07:08.270
Time to settle this.

01:07:09.270 --> 01:07:10.360
<i>Joker!</i>

01:07:18.400 --> 01:07:21.410
Party's over, Penguin.

01:07:32.250 --> 01:07:34.880
I'll give you the first shot
and send you back to the future.

01:07:37.720 --> 01:07:39.760
I'm gonna wipe that half-smile

01:07:39.840 --> 01:07:41.260
right off your face.

01:07:42.180 --> 01:07:46.810
Poison Ivy, see the strength of
this time period.

01:07:51.150 --> 01:07:55.940
I was convinced you'd
lost your memory, Joker.

01:07:56.990 --> 01:07:58.360
Yeah, about that.

01:07:58.820 --> 01:08:01.740
I had lost my memory.
I was a decent man.

01:08:03.410 --> 01:08:04.660
What a joke.

01:08:05.200 --> 01:08:07.040
I'm the Lord Joker!

01:08:07.750 --> 01:08:10.370
I hypnotized myself to believe

01:08:10.460 --> 01:08:13.040
I was someone else,
so you would believe it.

01:08:13.420 --> 01:08:19.420
And this little flower was the trigger
to snap me back to insanity.

01:08:22.550 --> 01:08:26.560
<i>We did it. They're finally growing.</i>

01:08:36.230 --> 01:08:38.440
Harley, get ready.

01:08:39.150 --> 01:08:41.450
Can't wait, Mr. J.

01:08:55.590 --> 01:08:58.800
<i>That's right. It was that flower.</i>

01:09:01.800 --> 01:09:04.800
<i>It's good to return</i>
<i>to the land, get your hands dirty.</i>

01:09:05.550 --> 01:09:09.470
<i>It sucks every evil thing from you,</i>

01:09:09.560 --> 01:09:12.980
<i>and puts the condensates back into flower.</i>

01:09:21.440 --> 01:09:26.990
<i>It made this game changer flower</i>
<i>bloom for me.</i>

01:09:33.500 --> 01:09:36.630
It's time to regret your weakness and die.

01:09:40.460 --> 01:09:41.710
Mr. J!

01:09:48.680 --> 01:09:50.850
Time for some girl-on-girl action.

01:10:23.090 --> 01:10:25.170
Careful, don't cut yourself.

01:10:25.510 --> 01:10:27.550
See you in a Gotham jail.

01:10:47.360 --> 01:10:51.410
Medicine is still working, kitty-kitty.

01:11:32.450 --> 01:11:35.080
Keep your tongue to yourself.

01:11:53.890 --> 01:11:54.930
Bruce.

01:12:22.710 --> 01:12:28.210
You've destroyed
a perfectly good giant robot castle.

01:12:28.300 --> 01:12:30.880
What are you gonna do with this mess?

01:12:31.760 --> 01:12:34.430
Let's end this, Joker.

01:12:34.850 --> 01:12:36.350
Same thing, again.

01:12:36.560 --> 01:12:38.430
We are on the big stage.

01:12:38.520 --> 01:12:43.100
Don't you have nicer things to say, Bats?

01:12:43.480 --> 01:12:45.650
I don't have time for this.

01:12:55.700 --> 01:12:59.950
In this country, people will say
"It's time to pay Nengu".

01:13:00.160 --> 01:13:02.710
-Nengu?
-Means tax.

01:13:02.830 --> 01:13:04.880
Surrender!

01:13:08.840 --> 01:13:10.340
That was a good one.

01:13:14.890 --> 01:13:17.600
Means you are done.

01:13:18.760 --> 01:13:23.520
When bad guys pay the tax,
that means they are done.

01:13:27.820 --> 01:13:32.070
If you don't have money,
why don't you pay with your life?

01:13:34.240 --> 01:13:36.030
I'm here!

01:13:38.080 --> 01:13:39.660
Shut your mouth.

01:13:39.740 --> 01:13:40.790
Sheesh.

01:13:52.920 --> 01:13:55.130
Must be tough being a hero!

01:13:59.010 --> 01:14:02.890
You don't dare kill me!
Isn't that right, Bats?

01:14:11.690 --> 01:14:14.400
See, you can't kill me.

01:14:27.210 --> 01:14:30.460
The hero can't finish the job.

01:14:32.210 --> 01:14:34.260
But I can.

01:14:35.090 --> 01:14:37.470
I can kill you.

01:14:37.840 --> 01:14:39.010
Batman.

01:15:04.000 --> 01:15:05.330
I'm not gonna fall.

01:16:11.400 --> 01:16:12.610
No way.

01:16:13.560 --> 01:16:15.070
It's not over!

01:16:56.070 --> 01:16:59.610
Return to the dust, Batman.

01:17:05.120 --> 01:17:07.870
It's your time to
return to the dust, Joker.

01:18:06.050 --> 01:18:08.550
Do it. Just let go.

01:18:09.100 --> 01:18:11.560
You can't do it, can you?

01:18:18.480 --> 01:18:23.650
The great Batman,
not such a hero after all!

01:19:00.810 --> 01:19:02.440
<i>Thank you for all your help.</i>

01:19:03.480 --> 01:19:07.070
Of course. Our country
can now return to the way it was.

01:19:07.660 --> 01:19:10.410
<i>We will never forget</i>
<i>what you have done for us.</i>

01:19:12.200 --> 01:19:14.790
Good bye, Monkichi.

01:19:17.620 --> 01:19:20.750
You will do fine without me.

01:19:57.790 --> 01:19:59.790
Activate the Quake Engine.

01:21:29.420 --> 01:21:30.760
<i>Master Bruce.</i>

01:21:34.050 --> 01:21:35.800
This is for you.

01:21:37.140 --> 01:21:39.140
Right, of course.

01:21:39.720 --> 01:21:41.850
Best not to keep the Mayor waiting.

01:21:42.480 --> 01:21:43.810
Is the car ready?

01:21:44.140 --> 01:21:47.150
Yes. But it's rather vintage.

01:21:56.240 --> 01:21:59.540
<i>Tell me, where did you</i>
<i>come across such a rare find?</i>

01:22:01.410 --> 01:22:03.620
I just came across it on a trip.

01:22:04.160 --> 01:22:08.040
Thanks for your business.
